          "english_quote": "while doing the things through Moses .... they do not hate the one they did not know",
          "issue": "The draft correctly represents the extant wording and retains the verified print's four-dot gap. Nevertheless, the gap leaves source content missing; this is not merely a choice between defensible interpretations. Coverage of the supplied print is complete, but the missing wording prevents certification of the passage as a complete translation. The block concerns missing source meaning, not an unverified transcription or a draft omission.",
